Starry is a special Celestis—exceptionally clever and exceptionally gluttonous. It would lead Shiny to steal Grand Starines that other Celestis couldn't bite through, then sharpen stones to pierce the thick skin and feast on the exceptionally delicious fruit within. Until one day, they discovered a pink Rare Grand Starine. Starry managed to eat the flesh, and unexpectedly Evolved into a Prismana Form Stellarys. The Stellarys's knowledge made Starry realize it now possessed powerful Magical abilities and could no longer live among Common Celestis, while its personality became mysterious and calm. But it still couldn't bear to leave. It tried to use its power to protect the Celestis Outpost. However, as Shiny searched for Grand Starines, hoping to meet it again, Starry sent everyone Blessed Grand Starines through a Starine rain, and bid farewell.FlutternymHolo-Battle Sim RewardsGot you!TimothéeZephyr Coast's Threefold OfferingThat symbol...
