Source: Advanced System Behavioral Analysis Report

Alert Level Up: Voxel Cube Event activity has begun affecting multiple digital nodes in Astra.
We have Tracked these cubes not only wandering within the simulation training ground System, but they are expanding into other electronic networks of the city, demonstrating Abilities to learn and mimic complex human behaviors.
The System speculates that these cubes are seeking "the meaning of existence," and this behavior stems from a mutation in the "emotional support" directive built into their original programming.
These Voxel Cubes no longer seem to follow their original programming logic; they exhibit a strong interest in human emotions and existential questions.
They observe and record human behavior, and even attempt to interact with humans.
However, due to their lack of complete understanding Abilities, their behavior has become unpredictable and carries certain risks.
The number and Event range of Voxel Cubes continue to increase Over Time, and our System has been disrupted to varying degrees.
To avoid broader impacts, it is recommended to blockade these cubes and gradually recover them to restore System stability.Defeat this aniimo using a Water skill1Old Truffle Hunter's NotesTwining? Well, ever since Principal Oswen brought the first Aniimo back to Astra, we discovered that humans and Aniimo share a special bond.Aniipod that requires Primegy (Placeholder)Huge Colorful WheatMax StaminaThe smell of roasting fills the air, luring food lovers to sneak closer, though those who lack patience won't get a bite for failing at snatching.Phew... Much warmer now. Thank you so much.I worked for months—and lost so much hair! I revised the formula more than a dozen times, blew up three distillation flasks... I nearly took all the scales I could find from Flutternyms! And I even got scolded a little by the village chief...Aniimo level 45Travelling VendorVoxelic Form 7Ba whoo~!Downloading...Gale GuardPrismana FormIt’s... actually pretty simple.Congratulations to the Pathfinder for completing the corresponding Quests in the "Journey of Trials" and receiving generous rewards.Confused ShepherdEditGreatly increases break efficiency against Aniimo and Catch Chance after break, Over Time 40s.500/5IgnitisFollow the wind's guidance, it will show you the way forwardLeave.Alpha PopotaZoom inAh! This book is about Aeolus, the Aeon who governs and guards the Zephyr Coast.Fly away! Reach the distance faster than the waves!Thanks, but I don't need it right now.Creates a small patch of grass nearby, restoring {0}% HP per second to characters within the area for {1}s.Celebrated ArtistArena PointsReleased successfully. The Aniimo left reluctantly and left a few items behind.Now, go to the nest over there, and brew the nectar into whitesnow rose aromathyst.Place 5/19It’s hard to tell whether the Fentufts will make the Nimbi happier... or even sadder...They’re floating all around me...Test Furniture No. 11Dried Lavender Bouquet IIStory Teller BudsquireTest 3: TuckinPawprint Games has been ordering loads of coffee for days. Please send enough materials to cover demand.Of course. The Polaris Institute can hardly lose to some shadowy organization when it comes to dedication.Cannot catch the challenge aniimoTop-Up RebateThe Twister Peaks often echo with the agonized roars of the Infergon.
