d those energy cubes?HemmingThis is my heart! Impressive, right!Load UnitThe Thunderstorm Thornblade has hard thorns and a ruthless heart. She shows no mercy to her challengers in defeating them and breaking off their thorns. Perhaps she was born this way, or maybe her nature changed after she lost her brother. Once an innocent flower, it was on that rainy night she blossomed the flower of mourning in her deepest sorrow, and since then, ruthless thorns began to grow on her. Given the choice, she would have preferred to stay with her brother, remaining as a couple of ordinary Budsquires they once were, or to have started sharpening her thorn as early as possible, so she could have defended her loved ones.Dungeon InviteWhitebox_Cuddly Sheep_Morphling (Deprecated)Maze of Thorns Tale 4Sheldon AvatarThis action will stop current production and the materials for all unfinished products will be refunded. Continue anyway?Astra Aniipod Specialty StoreHuh? Oh, right! Dr. Lewis did say a newcomer would be taking the title assessment today...
