Come and complete your <style=Hint_BgD>identity verification</style>!Astra Research InstituteEvent Time: Jan 24, 2026, 04:00 - Jan 26, 2026, 03:59 (UTC+8)
1. From Jan 24, 2026, 04:00 to Jan 26, 2026, 03:59 (UTC+8), Pathfinders can choose 1 of 3 Prismana Form Aniimo in Weekend Prayers and receive a prayer reward.
2. From Jan 24, 2026, 04:00 to Jan 26, 2026, 03:59 (UTC+8), a Prismana Egg will appear near a Branch in Idyll. All Pathfinders can claim the Prismana Egg, whether or not they joined Weekend Prayers.
3. The Prismana Egg is guaranteed to hatch into one of the three Prismana Form Aniimo featured in this Weekend Prayers event. The Prismana Form Aniimo chosen in Weekend Prayers on Saturday will have its hatch chance increased to 60%.
4. Pathfinders who do not join Weekend Prayers will have an equal chance of hatching any of the three Prismana Form Aniimo from the Egg.Thank you for finding all the lost masks. Ling's memories are finally complete!
