Field Notes Quests require at least 2 Aniimo to be dispatched to begin, including 1 Leader Aniimo. Upon completing Field Notes, you can obtain the corresponding basic rewards.
2. Reward Rating
The more Clues conditions are met by the dispatched Aniimo, the higher the basic reward rating, and the richer the Field Notes rewards you can obtain.
3. Serendipity Rewards
When Field Notes are completed, there is also a chance to obtain 1 "Serendipity Gift." Affected by the residual Energy of Legendary Aniimo, special rewards occasionally appear in the Area, and one of the following rewards will be randomly obtained:
·<style=Q_5>Leader Aniimo Random Acquired Potential +1</style>
·Star Essence ×1
·Capaseed ×5
·Vein Essence ×1
※<style=Q_5>The "Leader Aniimo Random Acquired Potential +1" effect can only be obtained once per Aniimo in their lifetime.</style>
※Aniimo with maxed Acquired Potential cannot obtain this effect.
4. Special Individual Bonus
Some "unique" Aniimo seem more likely to receive a response from the Area's residual Energy. Dispatching them to participate in Field Notes can improve efficiency and shorten the time required for Field Notes.UploadThe second stage steel claw that was triggered.Azure EchoesSome ancient text is carved on it—(Translator) I seriously doubt it...An orange fungus that seems to have absorbed the essence of the sun, with a cap as smooth as polished amber.
