and reach the finish line in a <color=#d89c28>very short time</color>!Unlock the Blazen Avatar1. Once the event begins, Pathfinders can choose one favorite Aniimo to seal inside an Egg. The selected Aniimo will be moved from Aniimo Management into the sealed Egg, where it will await its reunion with you.
2. After Open Beta begins, Pathfinders must log in with the same account used for this test to claim the Egg.
After Open Beta begins, unlock the corresponding Form in the Aniilog to hatch the Aniimo preserved during this event (there are no Potential Score requirements for Sparkling & Illusory rarities).
3. The hatched Aniimo will retain information such as the time it was first met before being sealed. We will do our best to preserve its appearance, stats, skills, and other details. Due to unavoidable factors during development, they may be adjusted according to the development version. When a sealed Aniimo is hatched again, its related data will be based on the Open Beta version.
