Now that it’s chosen you... it could be affecting your mind.Astra Journey Quests Item QuantityFluffy Swimming ProOf course. This time last year, I fought that fat otter for a day and a night!The evening breeze feels nice too~Click to place.Path of the BraveAdvanced CRIT DMG RuneI'll play Sariou!Multi-select limit exceeded.I knew it! That's why you're the first person I came to Invite to join the <style=Hint_BgD>brand new Field Notes operation</style>!When the Alpha Irisal was still an Iris, the former Alpha left it with a kid from Bloomville. The kid’s name was Clovis, a florist of Bloomville, born with a special perception of life. They became partners—the Irisal’s job was to dance on the flower fields to help them grow while Clovis perceived the status of each plant in order to make proper plans for cultivating them.
It was just another day, Clovis suddenly gave it a hair band. It turns out that a couple of days before, Clovis was given an urgent order, so he had to ask two other Irises for help and treated them with lots of nectar. But Clovis didn’t forget about his good friend. Floret did not know why it felt so sad, but Clovis noticed. He told it the prettiest hair band was for his best friend, Floret, and there was only one like it in the world.
