2. Pathfinders can consume search attempts to track it down on the Idyll Continent and Catch it.
3. The Institute will regularly replenish free search attempts for Pathfinders to support continuous exploration Over Time; if free search attempts are not consumed, they cannot be accumulated, so please search in time.
4. If Pathfinders currently have no free search attempts, they can consume the item "Vein Essence" and search attempts to conduct searches.
5. Pathfinders can complete Field Notes Quests related to this Aniimo to obtain generous rewards.
