1. From 4:00 on Lun 31, 2026 to 3:59 on Sol 1, 2026, Pathfinders can choose 1 of 3 Thunderstorm Form Aniimos to make a wish and receive a wish reward.
2. From 4:00 on Sol 1, 2026 to 03:59 on Sol 2, 2026, a Thunderstorm Aniimo Egg will spawn near the Branch on the Idyll Continent. All Pathfinders can claim the Thunderstorm Aniimo Egg, regardless of whether they participated in the wishing Event.
3. The Thunderstorm Aniimo Egg will definitely Hatch into one of the three Thunderstorm Form Aniimos from this Event. The Chance of Hatching the Thunderstorm Form Aniimo that the Pathfinder wished for will increase to 60%.
4. If a Pathfinder did not participate in the wishing Event, the Chance of Hatching each of the three Thunderstorm Form Aniimos will be equal.Catch different Aniimos at Berylline Causeway to increase <style=Hint_BgL>Area Catch Completion</style>. When Collection Progress reaches <style=Hint_BgL>40%</style>, you can obtain the Collection Progress Badges for this Area.

