There, an Aniimo phantom appeared, calling itself Aeolus, master of Zephyr Coast.
It told me that the twenty-sided Ancestor Prism in my hands was the World Core. It had sensed a change in the sun and moon, then showed me a vision from afar—
A group of mysterious figures in black robes had reached the ruins before my instructor. Using a forged twenty-sided Ancestor Prism, they stole Helion/Lunara from the mural where it slept!
After showing me that vision, Aeolus's dream began to collapse.
