The elder is worried about you, so he sent us to find you.Load StatusCoin MonsterLong ago, Baleetles scoured the land for quality stone balls to bring back to Berylline Causeway. One Baleetle found a perfect stone, but failed to push it over the mountain and bring it back. Every time it neared the peak, the ball rolled back down, dragging the Baleetle with it. Over time, this created a strange, straight path up the mountain. One day, the earth shook, the mountain crumbled, and a stone wall marked with the words “mountain path” fell onto Berylline Causeway, which was the only proof of this event. Later, other Baleetles saw this “mountain path” and used it as a natural racetrack. Years later, the rock turned pure cyan, nurturing a stoneflower within—a symbol of life blooming in the wrong place.Do we still need to go deeper?1. This game is a role-playing game suitable for users aged 12 and above. It is recommended that minors use this game under parental supervision.
2. This game is based on a fictional Lore. The Story tells of Pathfinders forming friendships with creatures from a fictional World and exploring adventures together in a new World. The plot is Easy and positive, with no adaptations based on real history or the real World. The scenes are bright and colorful, with upbeat and lively music. Pathfinders play as human Pathfinders in the game. Gameplay is based on physical operations of moderate difficulty and cognitive judgment of moderate difficulty, encouraging Pathfinders to achieve their goals through thinking and Training. The game includes a text and voice-based stranger social System.
3. This game has a real-name authentication System. Users authenticated as minors will be subject to the following restrictions: minor users may only log in to the game from 20:00 to 21:00 on Fridays, Saturdays, Sols, and legal holidays. They are not allowed to play at other times.
4. This game focuses on exploration and Training, and can cultivate Pathfinders' imagination and love for nature. In the game, every Pathfinder can form deep friendships with adorable fictional creatures and embark on a journey of Talents together, exploring unknown territories. During this process, Pathfinders will not only experience adventures, but also enjoy the joy of teamwork. The game design can bring optimistic and positive emotional responses to Pathfinders, guide Pathfinders to form positive emotional expressions, and gain a relaxed and comfortable emotional experience.Building Block - Baby BlueIt’s the Beeeautiful Voice Perfume!Requires Pathfinder title - Special RookieFlux CrystalPossible RewardsAfter being hit by <style=Hint_BgL>Shock Wave</style>, it will bloom from a bud into a Blossom and spray pollen that puts people and Aniimos into <style=Hint_BgL>deep Sleeping</style>.Spore VulnerabilityStreamlined AccelerationHabit Title PlaceholderMallSpecial Form Points...she achieved her goal with astonishing speed.CRIT DMG Rune[Limited Merchandise] Commemorative Badges#playerName#, what’s up? Gonna take some photos?
