This has to be the most unbelievable scene I’ve witnessed in my entire life.
An enormous Echoback showed up in the storm and guided its struggling brothers and sisters back into the depths of the sea, one by one.
Its powerful singing even drowned out the howling winds and thunder. It just kept singing until all the stranded Echobacks found their way back.
Watching its figure swimming through the waves, I realized that no storm lasts forever. 
Just like every storm I’ve been through, they always end with blue skies.

Day Fifteen
The storm has finally stopped.
I didn’t fail my reputation as an old sailor, just like the Echoback didn’t fail its brothers and sisters.
It brought them all back to the sea, but stayed behind... forever, on this shore.
The raft I made was too small to tow it, so I carved its tale into this stone.
I know that its bones will stand here for a very long time.

May its story be told for eternity.
May all sailors finally see their blue skies.ObsidianCall RescueLots of aniimo have appeared. Press <color=#D89C28>M</color> to open the map and check.Burn away the vines and head to the finish gateLovely music makes Aniimo dance and drives the turntable to grind spices, so that fragrances waft along with the melody.Dr. Lewis?Co-conspirator of the outsiders... forgive this unceremonious “reunion.” A century has passed without word between us—please pardon the First Lethal Thorn’s haste.Cole!!! I... I really turned into a Morphling!!Open Appearance ScreenStory-Desolate BGMBecome a Senior Student to unlockRadiant CharmNo furniture in this category.A Better Way to Clear ObstaclesAimo is a conscious, independent individual.The Scar-faced Helgon throws you into the sea, then fishes you out before you drown.Claim All RewardsWhy did you run away?Emberpup has met the evolution requirements. Click <style=Hint_BgL>Evolve</style>.0/1Morphi! Mo... Morphi... Morphi?! (...Oh? Figured me out, eh? And my most perfect disguise ever, no less...)Actual DMGRV reaches Level 5Tracking timeoutCan directly chain into the final hit of a normal attack.Among them, there is a type of <style=Hint_BgD>Rock</style> imbued with flames, which I believe is our ultimate target.
