Once Open Beta (OBT) begins, you can view and claim all rebates on the official website, including Lumin Crystal rebates, Monthly Passes, and special Companion Handbook rebate items.

Detailed rules: 
I. Rebate Rules Overview
1. Currency Rebate (Glimmer)
All cash purchases made during CBT3 (including direct purchases, Monthly Pass purchases, and Companion Handbook purchases) are counted cumulatively and rebated at tiered multipliers: 

Cumulative Purchase Amount        Rebate Multiplier        Description        
0-200 RMB (including 200 RMB)        200%        For example, a 200 RMB purchase returns Glimmer worth 200 RMB (2,000 Glimmer).        
200-3,000 RMB (including 3,000 RMB)        150%        For example, for a 300 RMB purchase, the portion above 200 RMB is rebated at 150%, meaning 100 RMB returns Glimmer worth 150 RMB (1,500 Glimmer). 
Portion above 3,000 RMB        110% 

Example: 
A player spends a total of 3,500 RMB during CBT3.
 
200 RMB portion (Tier 1: up to 200 RMB): 200 × 10 × 200% = 4,000 Glimmer
2,800 RMB portion (Tier 2: 200-3,000 RMB): 2,800 × 10 × 150% = 42,000 Glimmer
500 RMB portion (Tier 3: above 3,000 RMB): 500 × 10 × 110% = 5,500 Glimmer
Total: 51,500 Glimmer

2. Special Monthly Pass Rebate
In addition to the currency rebate, Monthly Passes purchased during CBT3 will be returned as items on the event page. The item takes effect immediately upon use, including instant rewards and Monthly Pass days. 
Rebate quantity: Up to 2 passes. There was no purchase limit during CBT3, but the rebate cap is 2 passes. Any excess is counted toward the purchase amount. 
How to Claim: View and claim on the official website rebate event page after Open Beta begins.
 
How to Use: 
Item validity: 360 days, counted from the day it is claimed. 
If you use it while your Monthly Pass days are below 150, you will immediately receive the purchase reward (instant Diamonds) and 30 days of benefits. 
If your Monthly Pass days are 150 or more, the system will display a pop-up message saying "Monthly Pass days have reached the limit." You must wait until the number of days decreases before using it. 

3. Special Companion Handbook (Path Pass) Rebate
Companion Handbooks purchased during CBT3 will be returned as corresponding items on the event page based on the actual purchase tier: 
Rebate rules: A 68 RMB tier purchase returns the corresponding 68 RMB tier item. A 128 RMB tier purchase returns the corresponding 68 RMB tier item. 
How to Claim: View and claim on the official website rebate event page after Open Beta begins.
 
How to Use: 
Can be kept across seasons. Can only be used when no tier of the current-season Path Pass is active. 
If a Path Pass is already active, the system will display a pop-up message saying "This version cannot be used. Please save it for a future version." The item will be kept for use in a later season.

II. Event Page Claim Instructions
Where to Claim 
