Forty
I went to too many places that were far, far away for too long.
The highlands and the sea that once excited me have now become mundane.
I drowned myself in business outside the woods. I was so close to it many times, yet I avoided it every time.
I just couldn’t go back there.
Going back there is like going back to where everything started, where everything stays the same.
Then I realized—I was merely afraid to go back.
I was afraid that the woods had changed.
I was afraid that it would always be sunny in the woods, making my memory of that day not so special anymore.
I was afraid that there would be no one waiting for me at that usual spot.
I guess what I was really afraid of was finding out that Tucker was no longer my friend.Yes, obtaining regional Collection Badges can unlock more Aniimo spawn location information.
