2. During the stage preparation phase, Pathfinders complete Quests before the orchestra's performance and Snap the corresponding Form of Aniimo to receive preparation rewards. Be sure to distinguish between Aniimo Forms—only Snapping an Aniimo that matches the Form Pathfinders voted for will complete the preparation.
3. During the official performance, the Aniimo Form chosen by Pathfinders will perform in Astra. Pathfinders can head to Astra to set off Fireworks to enhance the atmosphere and Snap photos of the Aniimo performance as souvenirs, earning a commemorative Avatar for this Event (can be claimed after official launch).
