Yeah, I’m almost certain it wasn’t my imagination!Look at me!BINI #9: UpgradedNope, this one’s different!1. During the event, Polaris Institute will refresh the current Ecological Investigation List every day at 04:00 AM (UTC–4).
2. Pathfinders must follow the investigation list and catch the corresponding Aniimo to help the institute complete its ecological investigation and earn Investigation Points.
3. Each target Aniimo only grants points the first time its investigation is completed. Catching the same target again will not grant additional points.
4. Please pay close attention to Aniimo Forms. Only catching an Aniimo in the same Form as listed on the investigation list will complete the corresponding investigation.
5. Once your daily accumulated Investigation Points reach the specified requirements, you can claim the corresponding milestone rewards.
6. If the investigation target is an Aniimo the Pathfinder has not caught before, the points earned for completing its investigation for the first time will be doubled.
7. When the investigation list refreshes daily at 04:00, your current total Investigation Points will be reset. Please claim your rewards in time.Observant HumminCalling Bolty: Wait... Why are we even calling each other out here in the middle of the night?
