1. During the Event, mysterious Vein rifts will appear across the Idyll Continent. Pathfinders can Transport there via the Event page.
2. Pathfinders can consume one <style=Q_5>Rift Beacon</style> to investigate the Vein rift and enter its depths—the legendary birthplace of Aniimo.
3. The Shop will be open for a limited time, where you can purchase <style=Q_5>Rift Beacons</style> or exchange Astral Beads for Event items.

「Gameplay Flow」
1. Upon entering the Vein rift, Pathfinders will encounter a Legendary Aniimo that has lost its reason and fallen into a frenzy.
2. Pathfinders must subdue the rampaging Legendary Aniimo within the battle time limit. Based on the <style=Hint_BgL>Battle Rating</style>, you'll receive item rewards and additional Throwing time. If time runs out, the Legendary Aniimo will flee and the session ends.
3. After battle, the Legendary Aniimo enters a brief controlled state. Pathfinders must Throw Aniipods at it within the soothing time limit to guide Energy and calm the Legendary Aniimo's agitated Heart. If time runs out, the Legendary Aniimo will flee and the session ends.
4. Each Throw restores Tranquility value. The higher the value of the Aniipod used, the more Tranquility is restored.
5. When the Tranquility bar fills completely, the Legendary Aniimo's affection level toward the Pathfinder increases by one tier. Pathfinders will receive gift rewards from the Legendary Aniimo and have a Chance to gain its recognition, causing it to willingly follow you.
6. The affection tier starts at 0 and ends at 10, at which point the session concludes. When a Pathfinder gains the Legendary Aniimo's recognition, the session ends.

「Important Notes」
1. At the end of each session, the accumulated affection between Pathfinder and Legendary Aniimo will be <style=Hint_BgL>reset</style>—don't miss your opportunity.
2. After the Event ends, unconsumed gameplay items will be <style=Hint_BgL>retained</style> and can be used for subsequent rift Field Notes gameplay.

「Reward List」
The rewards Pathfinders receive depend on the Legendary Aniimo's <style=Hint_BgL>affection tier</style> toward the Pathfinder.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>1</style>: Requires 10 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.25% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>2</style>: Requires 15 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.25% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>3</style>: Requires 20 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.25% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>4</style>: Requires 25 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.25% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>5</style>: Requires 30 Tranquility. Astral Bead×2, 0.5% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>6</style>: Requires 40 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.5% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>7</style>: Requires 50 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.5% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>8</style>: Requires 60 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, Starcryst Essence×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.5% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>9</style>: Requires 80 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, Starcryst Essence×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 0.5% Chance for Irisalis×1.
Tier <style=Hint_BgL>10</style>: Requires 100 Tranquility. Astral Bead×1, Starcryst Essence×1, Phenomena Crystal×1, 10% Chance for an additional Astral Bead×1, 1% Chance for Irisalis×1.

