At the Polaris Institute, small tests call for small celebrations, and big tests call for big celebrations...Astral Bead ExchangeFirefly? (It seems very curious)Hello, Pathfinder,
You have reached level 45. To ensure a complete experience during the testing period, we are now providing progression resource support to help you smoothly experience deeper game content.
We look forward to your valuable feedback during the testing period.Physical ATKLong ago, when the Blazen Alpha was still a little Bolty, it always stayed here with its mother.
Back then, it didn't believe that Lightening was a response, so it was never able to Evolve into a Blazen.
Until the day its mother left, it came to the Blitz Tree, desperately hoping the sky would give it a response.
At that moment, it Evolved into a Blazen.
In the quiet of night, it would always come beneath the Blitz Tree and call out deeply, but never received a response.
Yet it chose to believe, so it continued to guard the Blitz Tree, not only protecting the wishes of the other Boltys in their Hearts, but also protecting its own hope.
