The Academy is recruiting Pathfinders to dispatch Aniimo to various locations for Field Notes and bring back valuable observation photos and investigation records.
Event Instructions
1. During the Event, multiple Field Notes Areas will be progressively unlocked.
2. Each Area has different Field Notes objectives and environmental characteristics, requiring suitable Aniimo to be dispatched for exploration.
3. Upon completing Field Notes, you can obtain corresponding Area rewards and have a chance to receive additional Serendipity Gifts.
Field Notes Rules
1. Each Field Notes mission requires dispatching at least 2 Aniimo, with 1 designated as the Lead Aniimo before Field Notes can begin.
2. After completing Field Notes, base rewards will be granted based on the dispatch situation.
If the dispatched Aniimo meet the Area preference conditions, the reward rating can be increased.
3. Some Aniimo with special auras seem more likely to trigger environmental Resonance during Field Notes, which can improve Field Notes efficiency and reduce the time required.
Serendipity Gifts
1. Upon completing Field Notes, there is also a chance to obtain 1 "Serendipity Gift." Affected by the residual Energy of Legendary Aniimo, special harvests occasionally appear in the Area. One of the following rewards will be randomly obtained:
·<style=Q_5>Lead Aniimo Random Acquired Potential +1</style>
·Astral Essence ×1
·Capaseed ×5
·Vein Essence ×1
※<style=Q_5>The "Lead Aniimo Random Acquired Potential +1" effect can only be obtained once per Aniimo for life.</style>
