1. From Jan 24, 2026, 04:00 to Jan 26, 2026, 03:59 (UTC+0), Pathfinders can choose 1 of 3 Prismana Form Aniimo in Weekend Prayers and receive a prayer reward.
2. From Jan 24, 2026, 04:00 to Jan 26, 2026, 03:59 (UTC+0), a Prismana Egg will appear near a Branch in Idyll. All Pathfinders can claim the Prismana Egg, whether or not they joined Weekend Prayers.
3. The Prismana Egg is guaranteed to hatch into one of the three Prismana Form Aniimo featured in this Weekend Prayers event. The Prismana Form Aniimo chosen in Weekend Prayers on Saturday will have its hatch chance increased to 60%.
