1. After the Event starts, Polaris Institute will regularly announce Glamour Star audition themes.
2. Pathfinders can select suitable Aniimos and match them with Accessories around the current theme to complete registration.
3. The Institute will score participating Aniimos based on how well the Aniimo and Accessories match the theme.
4. When Pathfinders reach the corresponding score milestones, they can claim the corresponding rewards.
