Pathfinders can safely Transport Eggs off the island using an Egg Boat or simple Transport devices airdropped onto the island by Lumintech.Egg Heist ATKPlot 19Peculiar fruits nurtured by the Vein, their skins burst open to reveal star-like seeds within.Smashing StrikeZephyro is a Perfumer of the blended fragrance school, and the inheritor of legendary Perfumes.
But Perfumery is more like a responsibility for Zephyro.
Zephyro has an impractical wish of his own—
He wants to fly across the sea.
Fortunately, he has the Talents for Twining.
But unfortunately, he can only Twine with Flutternyms.
Without the wind's aid, butterflies cannot fly across the vast ocean.
Luckily, this Flutternym was once Zephyro's grandfather's Ally, and it knows clearly that singing the "Freedom" Score can make the Bell of Freedom open.
When the Bell of Freedom opens, a great wind will appear.
They can, like Zephyro's grandfather, ride the great wind and fly across the sea.
So Zephyro and his Flutternym always sing near the Bell of Freedom.
Regrettably, the Bell of Freedom has not opened, and the wind has even blown away the "Freedom" Score.
They are obsessed.
They cannot forget.
O great wind, when will you come?
Is our song not free enough? Why won't the Bell of Freedom open?
————
When the Bell of Freedom opened, Zephyro already understood that the freedom of flying away and the freedom of staying are the same.
But he still chose to depart with the Flutternym on the great wind.
Because that is the freedom they desire.
No nobler than the freedom of staying, simply what the Heart yearns for.
————
When this bottle of Freedom's Breeze Perfume was completed, Zephyro completely let go of everything.
He is no longer a Perfumer, and no longer bears the responsibility inherited from his ancestors.
He became very light, very light.
Because all he has is the wish to fly across the sea.
