During your adventure journey in the open World, complete Companion Handbook Quests, increase your Companion Handbook level, and earn rich Companion Handbook rewards!

Companion Handbook Version Notes
The Companion Handbook level progress rewards are divided into Standard and Premium versions. The Premium version requires unlocking the Premium Companion Handbook to activate. Rewards include 1 <color=#da8000>Prismana Fulmintis</color> with Perfect Acquired Potential, <color=#da8000>Fulmintis Soul (item to Evolve Fulmintis)</color>, and a series of other rewards, along with special perks: increased Aniimo Management Favorite pages.
Unlocking the Keepsakes Companion Handbook allows you to immediately receive more rewards and perks on top of unlocking the Premium Companion Handbook.

Quests and Companion Handbook EXP Notes
Quests are divided into Weekly Quests and Version Quests, each can only be completed once, with no weekly EXP cap.
Weekly Quests refresh every Monday at 04:00 (UTC +8). All Quests close when the current Companion Handbook ends.
You can also earn Companion Handbook EXP through Sol Activity in the Academy Guide.

Gifting Notes
You can initiate a gift to Friends who meet the Affinity requirement and have not yet unlocked the Premium or Keepsakes version of the Companion Handbook. They will receive 1 item that can activate the Premium and Keepsakes versions of the Companion Handbook.Jump a hundred times a day, and you'll turn into a Pranky!Select CourseThe barrier seems to be acting up...
