Fifty-Five
I went to the usual spot, but I couldn’t really go back there,
Since there is no more “there” to go back to.
...
Tucker is dead.
...
I saw the vine core he left behind—
A blue flower.
...
It contained our memories.
Now, there is only me to remember them.
...
It was waiting for me to take it to those far-away places with me,
But I never knew that.
...
In its last memory, it asked me,
“Is Echoback Landing the far-away sea I was talking about?”
It didn’t want to go to any place far away, unless it was with me.Example phrases, filler words, Twine words (placeholder)We introduce ourselves to Selene and explain the purpose of our visit...UIDPrismana Witchin EggIndividuals larger in size than the average AniimoAs lovely as it sounds... doesn’t merging with the vein simply mean you’re <style=Hint_BgD>being consumed by it</style>?That sounded wonderful! Go talk to Judy.Pupils 15Defense TrainingBed decor for Homeland.A cute height-measuring pillar marked for Aniimo, recording every little step of their growth.Light UpReset LaterWords of the Wind
