2. Pathfinders can select suitable Aniimos and match them with Accessories to complete their contest registration based on the current theme.
3. The Institute will score participating Aniimos based on how well the Aniimo and Accessories match the theme.
4. When a Pathfinder's score reaches the corresponding milestone, they can claim the corresponding reward.
