Today is the first Sol of our acquaintance. "We" doesn't refer to me and someone else, but to me and this notebook.
From today on, it will be my diary. As the saying goes, "paper is more patient than people." From now on, all my perceptions and all my Lore,
it will know and share with me.



Lun 29th Sol
I have to say, having a diary to confide in feels absolutely wonderful.
