1. From 4:00 on Lun 31, 2026 to 3:59 on Sol 1, 2026, Pathfinders can choose 1 of 3 Thunderstorm Form Aniimos to make a wish, and receive a wish reward.
2. From 4:00 on Sol 1, 2026 to 3:59 on Sol 2, 2026, a Thunderstorm Aniimo Egg will spawn near the Branch on the Idyll Continent. All Pathfinders can claim the Thunderstorm Aniimo Egg regardless of whether they participated in the wish Event.
3. The Thunderstorm Aniimo Egg will always Hatch into one of the three Thunderstorm Form Aniimos from this wish Event, with the Hatch Chance of the Thunderstorm Form Aniimo that the Pathfinder wished for increased to 60%.
