1. Aniimo's six core Attributes have both [Innate Potential] and [Acquired Potential].
<style=Hint_BgL>[Innate Potential]</style> is determined at birth and can only be improved through special means like Capafruit.
<style=Hint_BgL>[Acquired Potential]</style> can be enhanced through Capability Awakening. The more times you enhance, the more and rarer the items required.
However, the <style=Hint_BgL>combined total of Innate Potential and Acquired Potential</style> has a maximum of <style=Hint_BgL>20</style>. The higher the Acquired Potential, the greater the Attribute growth as the Aniimo levels up.
