1. From Jan 24, 2026, 04:00 to Jan 25, 2026, 03:59, Pathfinders can choose 1 of 3 Prismana Form Aniimo in Weekend Prayers and receive a prayer reward.
2. From Jan 25, 2026, 04:00 to Jan 26, 2026, 03:59, a Prismana Egg will appear near a Branch in Idyll. All Pathfinders can claim the Prismana Egg, whether or not they joined Weekend Prayers.
