Clear all debris from this plot to receive <link="item_4001064"><style=Hint_BgL><u>Wood Block</u></style></link> *<style=Hint_BgL>14,124</style> and <link="item_4001065"><style=Hint_BgL><u>Mineral Sand</u></style></link> *<style=Hint_BgL>8,250</style>.Guess we're heading deeper.Defeat 5 Aniimo using an Aniimo with an advantageous element.Cancel Hustle state.The flower seems unusually large...This was once the White Plateau, second in elevation to Twister Peaks, its lands blanketed in deep snow.
Beardow Woods was the only path leading to the White Plateau.
Dangerous Cubbos staggered about, their threatening growls echoing around.
Budsquires shivered as they braved the bitter wind and snow to reach the White Plateau.
For here grew a marvelous flower that had the mysterious power to make Cubbos keep their distance.
Gradually, the people of Bloomville also discovered that white flower.
At first, the Bloomville folk and the Budsquires lived on opposite sides of the flower, leaving each other undisturbed.
Slowly, they began to communicate with each other and live together on the White Plateau.
As the Melloblum performed the Dance of Blissful Bloom, the white flower blossomed against the bitter cold and whirling snow.
It was called the “whitesnow rose”—a miracle on the snow.
The miracle of a beautiful flower blooming amid a harsh and unforgiving world.
And the miracle of the Bloomville folk and Budsquires living together and helping each other.
Where the whitesnow rose grows is a shared homeland of both the Bloomville people and the Budsquire family.Astra Social ButterflyDefend the Budsquires’ domain!Mountain Sanctum Barrier DissipatedUnlock plot 15Oh, you’re the Whelpy from the daytime. Whelpy’s guarding the chest, but Whelpy’s so sleepy.Hide quickly...Oh... they ran away.Having fun and researching at the same time—pretty efficient, right?A very brave BudsquireCopied face ID detected in the clipboard. Do you wish to apply it?There is a prismana flow in {0}! Chance to get {1} is UP!A strange claw mark appeared on the sample garment. I need fabric that can perfectly restore its shape and texture.Are you sure you wish to take out this Aniimo?ObserverYou’re also a perfumer?Group name already existsIts untamed heart beats with the rhythm of electric dance steps.Where's number three?Why are you lying down again?<color=#D89C28>Bombardment Barrage</color> warning! <color=#D89C28>Dodge quickly</color>!Most Aniimo can <style=Hint_BgL>evolve</style>. Check the Aniilog for more details.ECS Whitebox_Level 1 VinePress #kHud/SkillE#z to cast the skill to break the floor, and move to the next objective.Worn PaperI’m done for!Yeah. You look like a student of the Polaris Institute. My name is Sayn, from the Aniimology department.Their massive body looms, closing in like a billowing wave.You noticed it too, right? This mushroom is a bit strange!...Right, from the beginning. That day the Bloom Festival couldn't be held officially, and Sunia insisted on going to the Amethyst Tree to check the situation.Own 1 Prismana AniimoAfter completing the party, you can get an overview of the <style=Hint_BgL>Aniimo party</style> hereAlright, I’m leaving.Solo Mode - (Common)Can't help it, there are always lovestruck otters running into Shelly's territory looking for Shells.Stealth-CatchingThis heating vessel was excavated from ruins in Idyll.
