and wings bear you across the gorge.It’s an <style=Hint_BgD>Aniimo egg</style>. I found it nearby after the last Sherro returned to the stars.The concert begins.Unlocks Emote - SmirkGo ahead, the chest is all yours!14~20Some of the others said they spotted you on Beast Fang Ridge. I’ve got a favor to ask—come back to the Outpost when you can. (Keep it quiet—the Icho wants to see you.)Night Owl ChampionOwn 1 Sparkling Prismana Glameep.Switching to a higher-grade Aniipod can improve your catch chance.Fragrancier AvatarMakeshift Holo LottoThere’s nothing to eat here, so I’m going back!Alright! Found the owner—time to go race! Smell ya later!Stand close to the ice, press #kHud/SkillE#z to cast a <style=Hint_BgL>Fire</style> skill to <style=Hint_BgL>melt</style> the ice in your way and get to the next objective.I want to explore more, Polaris Institute is so big!Toy shop ownerOrangeBaa-Baa DarkbubbCelestis Research Report IIIAh, #playerName#! I’ve been wanting to meet you!Hey, friendo, I’ve got a few handy tips for you...That’s rough—you just got back, and you’re heading out again already.Prerequisite Quests RequiredSenior Xiaochen...? Are you here?You seem anxious—have you lost something important?Large Bouncing Mushroom (3-Leaf)Increases Lightning damage dealt by <customRichText(calcData,buff, 9147404,param0,1,%d)>%.Upgrade your RV to <style=Hint_BgL>Level 5</style> and unlock the RV <style=Hint_BgL>Power Module</style> to switch certain Home facilities into electric mode.Power of NatureMy great-grandfather was a musician who once inspired people with music in an age when all things had lost their color.
But music that could heal the soul could not conquer hunger.
He collapsed to the ground.
It was only when a Perfumer fed him sweet nectar that he was able to awaken.
Later, he could not bear to refuse this Perfumer's request, and inherited her mantle, also becoming a Perfumer.
He felt trapped in a place without wind.
...
A long time later, he could finally bear it no longer, so he ran wildly and came to a cliff.
At that time, Argent Strait was still a colorless land, and had not felt the Guardian's grace like Bloomville had.
And Crescendo Cliff had only endless raging winds, called the "deadly land of a thousand winds."
Yet it was in this deadly land that my great-grandfather met some gulls singing in the wind.
So they sang loudly together... the raging winds could not take away their souls.
They were free.
They sang of freedom.
...
Many more years passed, and the Guardian returned Uncommon to the earth, and Argent Strait was able to Revive.
And right there on Crescendo Cliff, my great-grandfather Twined with the gulls, soaring and singing in the fresh, natural wind.
This song gave birth to the Bell of Freedom.
This brought freedom, brought the great wind leading to Faraway places.
...
My great-grandfather passed the Perfumer's mantle to my grandmother.
He was truly free.
I heard that riding the great wind, he went to the place he wanted to go.
I envy him very much.
...
If only the Flutternym could fly across the sea.
My Ally and I have always thought this way.
If only there were a great wind leading to Faraway places.
I think, riding the great wind, we would surely find freedom.
...
