I've decided to retrieve the treasure she once lost. It may take a very long time, and I may no longer have time to confide in you, my diary.
I will leave you behind, leave you to this Grassland, hoping that this Grassland will also know me, remember me, and preserve the traces of my existence.
I may never return. Thank you for being by my side all these Sols.



Postscript:
If my diary is seen by someone, I want to tell you that this is indeed a wonderful place.
I hope you love this Grassland, these clouds, and this sky. Please look up at the Stars from time to time.
They must be just as beautiful as when I was here.
May the Gryphon God bless you and bring you joy here.Something strange is up ahead, but no matter how much Whelpy bumps into it, nothing happens.Increases Physical damage dealt to enemies.I don't have the courage.You're good to have noticed this, but maybe you want to take a look at other options?Want to start over? No problem! Just be careful not to fall!Wow, you finished already?
