The withered land bloomed with color once more. Flowers opened in full splendor, and a brilliant Prismana glow spread above.
Irelia looked up at the light she had always longed for, smiled, and bowed to it. Then she became petals, falling softly into the Vein.Originally, it was a rare flower that grew in the sea of blue blossoms, azure, with petals that drooped as if bowed in quiet weeping. After the Fentufts appeared in Driftwise Meadow and started to spread joy wherever they went, those petals slowly took on a soft golden hue. For a long time after, blue-and-gold flowers bloomed across this land. But as more Fentufts have appeared, the Nimbis have chosen to leave for places far away from their cheery ways, where they can enjoy their sorrow. And so, having lost that aura of melancholy, the bittersweet blooms began to droop once more. Thus, they have not produced their precious dew for quite some time.I’m... I’m really talking to an Aniimo!Poor Skippy...Whoo! Susuta, whoo!But in my prime, I could just roar lightly and shake the Chest right down, hehe!That sounds beautiful...Promotion Assessment must be completed to unlock talents and learn character skills. Congratulations on unlocking <style=Hint_BgL>Level 4 Skill</style>.From: Pathfinder Name (Placeholder)How interesting! Do they dislike the smell of mature black truffles?Defeat Xiaochen in Challenge ModeBy completing <style=Hint_BgL>Required Training Courses</style>, you can eventually enter the <style=Hint_BgL>Title Promotion Assessment</style> stage. Passing the Assessment will raise your Pathfinder Title, thereby increasing your character Level cap.So it doesn’t merely imitate living beings. It can explore, learn, feel, and experience the world like a living creature, perhaps even an intelligent one... I must admit, you’ve discovered something extraordinary.Max HP<customRichText(calcData,buff,5001201,param0,1,%d)>% Shield, when the Shield ends, the undamaged portion Heals alliesWith a homogeneous texture, a slight pinkish-brown color, and ripple-like patterns, it emits a light flowery scent.Rising Egg Scout IILotus-root Pink Sentime