Aniimo with level 3 flying ability can also use "Fast Flight." Tap <style=Hint_BgL>#kPlayer/StartSprint#z</style> to enter high-speed flight.Sparkling Chance IncreasedTen years ago, during the Bloom Festival’s Prismana Flow, the Academy was fortunate enough to preserve several Prismana Eggs. They have slumbered quietly ever since, waiting to meet the finest Pathfinders. Go choose one. It is destined to walk beside you on the journeys ahead.Guiding IncenseWhen a skill hits a target, increases their BREAK damage taken by 6% per stack, up to 5 stacks. At max stacks, increases it by an extra 20%. Lasts 15s.A long night has passedAmong all Lumin Ambers, there is a shy type. Follow it to obtain one! An Incredible Aniipod that guarantees a successful Catch of an Aniimo, with the Aniimo's Acquired Potential being at least <style=Q_4>Elite</style>.Parasol PineAstra-NPC Duel PlaneJumping around on the ice must be so much fun, but fish can't use Ice Orb...After learning of Lady Irelia’s grace, everyone went to thank her.
