e food to the fainted PopapusFind the EavesdropperFind Senior YangyangEar HeightFind Perfumer Ranka.Bloom: Tideblossom CoastRaise Helion to level 15.Burn the vines blocking the way and get to the next checkpointCheck: No Flameheart StoneLook for clues about the eavesdropperIs there some connection between the cliffs?Explore Idyll!There are 4 Wood Blocks in the Home WarehouseCheck the Lumen.Find the Flameheart Stone at the summit of the Russet Highlands. It seems to be near something big and dangerous. Be careful!Put in 3 large StarinesReturn 3 StarinesAn item shop that sells aniimo training items.After the old Sherro returned to the stars, the peace along the shore was shattered.Use the portal at the back of the RV to enter your Home.Say goodbye to ShellyTalk to the elder and attend the festival.Perfumer Ranka lies on the road and seems to need help.An Outpost for Pathfinders to take a rest and report the Aniimo they’ve caught.Head to the green target ahead.Bonesky from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!A makeshift boat made from a giant aniimo egg.
