Practice the song.Return to Sherro's beach at nightHelion seems to have found somethingEvery legendary perfume tells a story, its scent shaped by the colors and spirit of the earth.Search for treasure.Go back to the NorthsideEvacuation PointInvestigate around the whale bones.Look for where the Flutternyms gather.Promote to Novice Pathfinder.As time passes, grand halls crumble into ruin. Among the broken walls by the cliff, traces of the past can still be seen.Budsquire Tea Party?Offer the melancholic fluff.An RV Park by a lake in Driftwise Meadow. Pathfinders can rest, make friends, decorate their camping platforms, gain Park Buffs and send Aniimo on quests in there. <style=Hint_BgL>Find Park Manager Yu to activate it</style>.Talk to Senior CiciBeast Fang Ridge is home to legends of Scorchhowl, Glynsera, and Ghost Glynsera, and all of them seem closely tied to Icho's past. What happened between them? Perhaps defeating them will reveal the answer.Talk to WendellInvestigate the Voxel CoreThe pines whisper softly, flowers dance in the breeze.Burn out all the vines covering the wall, and climb to the finish gate.Discuss tomorrow’s plan with Nicole.The Icho’s Request.Tuckin of the Mistwoods. Every tree and blade of grass in the forest is an extension of its power.Follow Fannie and take a tour of the RV.Complete 4 required quests in Chapter 4.Bloom: Mudstone PassSearch for Super Truffles deep in the Mistwoods. Could the finest Truffles be near the legendary Tucking...A unique Aniimo nest found only in the Lost Isles. You may be able to dig up a precious <style=Hint_BgL>Darkler Egg</style> here.Talk to Sunia.An RV Park on an island beach in Echoback Landing. Pathfinders can rest, make friends, decorate their camping platforms, gain Park Buffs and send Aniimo on quests in there. <style=Hint_BgL>Find Park Manager Sesa to activate it</style>.Immersed in the performance, it can change and hold dance poses at will, fully controlling the plants within the “stage” and shaping them however it likes.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteAre you looking at the sea?Alpha Aniimo: IrisalGo to Nimbus Fields and check out the cheerful girl's new invention.From the cliff’s edge, the sea rocks beside the isle come into view. Faint ancient Lumin Amber markings can be seen among them, each one tracing the path of history.Talk to Loulla and switch to night.Twine into <style=Hint_BgD>Iris</style>, and dance with IrisWhat did Perfumer Zephyro leave behind?-137962771Mouth CornersListen to Helmut's whispers.By the frozen lake, white snow lies deep and still.HandsIf the “Rusty Iron Sword” carries the courage of the legendary Pawney, then the “Broken Helmet” seems to carry its friendship with the painter Sorora. Find the “Broken Helmet” and give it to Sorora.="This is"&J55&", detailed description for self-modification"Talk to the two PopapusOfferThe Blitz Tree is a unique symbol of Blitzwood, where lightning constantly strikes nearby. During the day, some Bolties gather there—are they... making phone calls?The resilient Minespine, with Energy of the earth surging through the crystals covering its spine<BR>Respawn interval: 1 minuteThe young girl Leah is always looking around the Tideblossom Coast during the day, as if searching for something. What is she searching for... a lighthouse? But where is there even a trace of a lighthouse nearby?WidthBeneath the swaying shadows of this ancient tree, a Lumin treasure lies hidden.Lumin Marking: Green ShadeGo to the Institute and ask Dr. Bohr for more informationAdventurous Cozite - The Fierce WisptisGo check beneath the Blitz Tree during the day.Who are those birds...?Voxel Coins can be used for a prize draw.A New Knight?Approach the source of the singing.Look around for cluesBaleetle from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Why was a Budsquire there? Looks like it ran away from Rosetower Wood. Were they being pursued by something very threatening?Visit Pawprint Shop in Astra Square and trade for a few mysterious finds...Dr. Glass is waiting for you deep inside the Budsquire maze!Let's draw out those Hummin!Catch up to BINI #9!Go to the next green checkpointChallenge XiaochenBloom: Sandcastle HillPrepare for the theory assessmentAt night, there is a Bulbly by the edge of the cliff, as if lost in thought, or perhaps waiting.Lumin Collection: WaterglideGo to the Perfume Workshop and find Sunia to craft SpicesTalk to Dr. GlassAt the Helmut Habitat, the painter Sorora is troubled by a blurry painting. What kind of riddle is “A ghost swings a sword at a dragon”?Keep growing stronger in Idyll!Alpha Aniimo: TubsterHelmut says Infergon is guarding the Sword of Bravery at the mountaintop. A dragon and a sword... that has to be connected to Sorora's painting. Now Helmut is rushing up the mountain, hoping to pull out the sword while Infergon is distracted. Can it really pull this off?Bloom: Zephyrus LandbridgeProceed to the target position!Is there some kind of pattern on the pillar ahead?Iris from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Emberpup from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Received a call from Dr. LewisGo to Echoback Landing and meet Dr. Lewis and Nicole.Talk to Prof. BohrSoil and stone have buried the ancient path, while grass and trees have hidden the traces of human activity, leaving only silent ruins behind.Icho has prepared a special lesson for you: discover what fighting truly means and become a true warrior. To do that, you'll need to explore the legends of Beast Fang Ridge. <style=Hint_BgL>Go to Beast Fang Ridge and complete the prerequisite quest: Warrior.</style>An RV Park between the romantic Sea of Flowers and a pine forest. Pathfinders can rest, make friends, decorate their camping platforms, gain Park Buffs and send aniimo on quests in there. <style=Hint_BgL>Find Park Manager Ben to activate it</style>.LengthFind Sunia at the square and say goodbye.Graceful and elegant, Glameep lingers in the dreamlike mirror lake, gazing at its own reflection as it quietly guards the fading echoes of the past.Dr. Lewis seems to have more to tell you.Give the bittersweet dew to Fantine.Ask the mysterious person about their intentionsWhy has Perfumer Fantine come here? She seems to be worried about something... Should you try comforting her?Observe the helmet.Check what's wrong with the Amethyst Tree.Alpha Aniimo: GlynseraWho is the eavesdropper? They seem to have left something behind. Do you wish to further uncover the eavesdropper’s secret?Leave Holo-Battle SimUse Spatial Counters to defeat the Budclaw!Lumin Marking: Cliff VistaHead to the transporter at the finish point and complete the tutorial sessionDefeat the Susuta!Cooperate with wild Aniimos, activate the bouncing plants, and reach the gate at the high destinationBloom: Forest of Falling StarsSave up 1000 Home Coins!What is Coinwisp looking for?There seems to be some kind of pattern on the whale bone.Bloom: Whiterose TowerThe Bulbly seems to be thinking really hard.Avetine, the Troubled PerfumerSay goodbye to Dael.Go to the Russet Highlands and search for the fragrance of courage.Susuta from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!There is no trace of perfumer Zephyro or his Flutternym companion at Crescendo Cliff.Eavesdropper ITwo frightened Popapus are hiding nearbyFollow Yu and find Momo.The Miraculous SeedlingWait for the next adventure.Twine with a Scorchhowl to ignite the vines with Fire BoltComplete the required quests in Elite Training Chapter 3.Lumin Energy Collection: Stone Tree ClimbTorso="This is"&J60&", detailed description for self-modification"Charge the batteries, then watch the metal crate conduct electricity and power the fan.The towering iceberg is dusted with fine snow, its layers glowing with a cool pale-blue sheen like frozen crystal.Make the gears rotateTwine with an Aniimo!A Trespassing Perfumer?Set fire to the tall grass to produce a wind field and ride the wind to the platform above.Put out the fire and head to the next checkpoint.Dragon Legend IILumin Marking: Frozen StoneYou are leaving Bloomville. Find Sunia at the perfumery and say goodbye.Go to the center to investigateGet ready to set out and buy Aniipods from JoffGather the three scattered blossoms.Lumin Marking: Ruins of FlowersGive the Burst of Red to Cress.Though the statue on the grassland has weathered countless years, its eagle-sharp gaze still watches the distance, as if fixed on something unseen.The old Omega Sherro once said that when the stars return to the sea, they will one day fill the night sky again. A few days have passed since then. Have the Aniimo on the beach learned to coexist peacefully? And is that little Shelly still as prone to tears as before?Show the Broken Helmet.Take out 7 StarinesThis is ≪J67≫. Please modify the description manually.The show's starting! Head over to the stage and snap a selfie with the performing aniimo!Lumin Marking: Above the White CliffsCapture the Moment Budclaw is StunnedSomething Threatening?Russet Highlands is the most dangerous area on the entire continent—be prepared and be careful!Why would the Budsquire have a tea party at Wildflower Cottage on a sunny day?Lumin Marking: Frostlit TraceWait until <style=Hint_BgL>tomorrow (real-world time)</style>Track Point 2Zephyro, the perfumer, gazes at the Bell of Freedom by the cliffside and murmurs to himself.An item shop that sells various toy items.Bolty from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!A Bulbly gazing at the sea?Lumin Energy Collection: Leap HigherThe sturdy and steady Tubster stands firm against the wind and waves along the coast.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteThe reappearance of the legend of Pawney seems to have brought about some changes.Check on Floret.Challenge Jili and complete the assessmentLook for where the Irises gather.Submit 7 StarinesUse the sketched clues to find the right Aniimo.Follow Nicole on a tour of the academyHelp the senior a little moreAt night, Beast Fang Ridge becomes deep, quiet, and eerie—perfect for Pathfinders from afar to explore. You notice that several Emberpups seem to be deliberately guiding you toward the dead forest, but they don’t appear hostile. Since that’s the case, why not go along with it?Lumin Marking: Shaded StoneUse Call Friends on FlutternymIn the Outpost, there is an Aniimo researcher named Sayn sitting on a chair.ThighsUse a Water Skill to activate the Bouncy Pads, then use the Bouncy Pads to bounce towards the next checkpoint above.Alpha Aniimo: Bouldus-1116472677On the second night, you heard the legend of the Undefeated Warrior. Just like the night before, an "eavesdropper" was secretly listening in. That's where the second night's story ends. What will the third night reveal? If you're curious too, wait quietly for the next night to arrive. <style=Hint_BgL>Real time: 1 day later.</style>Bloom: Beachside SandbarsRaise Lunara to level 15.Follow Nicole and start your Aniimo-catching adventure!Talk to SelensExplore more of the story behind Beast Fang Ridge...Use Fire to melt ice and head to the next checkpoint.Go to the RV Park in Driftwise Meadow.Concealment? Stealth! The Great Mushroom Hunt!Twine with EmberpupDr. Glass's Research has encountered some difficulties. Transform into Susuta to help him complete his Research!Lower Eyelid AngleAt Twister Peaks, on the Stormy Summit, lies Infergon's most treasured treasure.AskTwine with a Shelly and get to the checkpoint ahead[Capture] Emberpup!Learn about Carried ItemThe patterns on the stone flicker in and outSet the farmland recipe to Wheat.Keep patrolling with the Sparkly ShellyActivate the branch.Determine: Possess Echoback SaltShipwreck BayAria told you the story of "Flowers and Thorns" without charging a fee. Instead, she asked you to look after Awen if you meet her in Rosetower Woods. Who is Awen, and what does she mean to Aria?The aloof Geoclaw bears glowing crystal amber on its back, beautiful yet dangerous.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteCatch complete. Go to Nicole!Find or own a <style=Hint_BgL>Tubster</style>.Submit vine cores.Go back to Bloomville with Sunia after your exploration.Use the Call Friends command to summon wild ShellyBattle Senior LuriaLook for Sunia.Plant WheatIn broad daylight, under the open sky, Perfumer Ranka lies on the road. Why is no one helping him? Go help him, Pathfinder—the time to show the light of humanity has come!Twine with a Susuta-family AniimoAsk Bohr.Place a Grass Blossom Mat in your Home.Use Scorchhowl’s Drop Kick to smash through the floor and reach the next target point.GlossA spirited lupine fighter.<BR>The stronger the opponent, the more fired up it becomes. Fire and charcoal mark its path to greater strength.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteReach the AreaDewy from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Aniimo Alpha: GrizboTalk to the mysterious AniimoTalk to Peppy's owner.Rotation SpeedMagmarex lurks deep within the cavern, where fierce heat surges through the crimson crystals covering its body.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteBeneath the green canopy, a cool breeze stirs, and a mysterious pattern can just be seen on the great tree.Lumin Marking: Gate of RuinsListen to the Emberpups tell... ghost stories?Nicole may have fallen to another place...Gather the vine core in the northern cave.This is a Sanctum, modify the specific description as neededThe ruffled old Bolty tells you that if you're curious about what other Bolties are thinking, you can hide behind the Blitz Tree at night and listen in. The way it acts so mysteriously suggests these visitors are no ordinary guests.Talk to the enlarged Scorchhowl.Nicole Dialogue Progress 1Complete 3 required quests in Chapter 7.Process Wheatmeal once using the Carousel MillSing with the Windgliders.Go to the Sea of Flowers.Warning: Omega-class Aniimo<BR>Danger Level: HighReturn to Outpost and report to Dr. LewisPlace 8 Woodlands in HomeTalk to Icho about the legend of Beast Fang RidgeCheck on Senior Xiaochen.Defeat the Infergon and make the legend of Pawney live again.Chat with the birds.Lumin Marking: Northern Woodland of the Flower SeaDiscuss the Meaning of Battle with the Icho.Find out why the bittersweet bloom won’t blossom.Check the blooming <style=Hint_BgL>Bell of Freedom</style>.Touch the strange blossom.Defeat Flameruff · The Mighty and obtain the Unbroken Flameruff SpiritAsk around about the Inferlupa.Show the photo to Cozite.Urban railway entrance/exit of AstraUse the fan's airflow to reach the higher platform and arrive at the final gateLevel increased to 45Defeat the Turbo.Go to ChillBeanz and look for Lucas.AnglePerfumer Fantine sits by the river, seemingly lost in thought.See what Clovis is doing.Amid this sea of green grass, the stone pillar and the ruined gate behind it speak of an ancient legend. When the pillar and gate become one, a story long sealed by time begins to unfold.Report the Holo-Battle Sim results to LitaGo to Echoback Landing and search for the scent of renewal and return.Get to the checkpoint within the tall grassTalk to Lita.Before going to the Branch, collect Lumin Amber firstGive the salt to Sunia.Using the Explosive Barrel's Trait of exploding when exposed to fire, blast open the rubble and proceed to the exit gateSubmit 5 large StarinesAn Aniipod store that sells Aniipods of different grades.Collect six regional forms of Iris.Help the anxious NimbiReserve an RV through the GoGoHomes system.Perfumer Avetine hopes her apprentice will graduate as soon as possible so she can set off on her carefree travels. Unexpectedly, her apprentice just can’t seem to get the hang of things, leaving her deeply troubled. She needs help from a capable Pathfinder like you!Go here to find Tucking.Bloom: Rosetower WoodsBloom: Forgotten MineLumin Energy Collection: Springy TuftballInvestigate the coast.Promote to Skilled Pathfinder.Find the eavesdropper.Wake Shelly <style=Hint_BgL>(try using shock waves)</style>.This is an Alpha, specific description can be modified as neededTwine with a Susuta!Quietly blend in with the Emberpup family.Grizbo, gentle by nature, chooses to live in solitude to avoid harming its companions, sealing its ferocious side deep within a mountain cave.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteAbundant fire elements have stained these rock walls their distinctive russet hue.Did Budsquire's brother, who left on a stormy day, become Thunderstorm Thornblade?Return to Outpost and find Dr. LewisNot enough Aniipods, go find Nicole.Dr. Lewis is contacting you.Protected by an unknown power, the ice in the cave remains frozen for eternity. A faint Lumin Amber pattern can be seen through the ice, whispering tales from a forgotten age.The elegant and dignified Leafy lives in ponds blanketed with lotus leaves.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteThe spices are ready. It’s time to visit Velouria.Observe the tombstone.Give the Treasured Large Starine to DaelAn RV Park between Nimbus Fields and Mistwoods. Pathfinders can rest, make friends, decorate their camping platforms, gain Park Buffs and send Aniimo on quests in there. <style=Hint_BgL>Find Park Manager Umi to activate it</style>.Lower Eyelid FoldWhere sea breeze and gull cries rise together, thorn-covered rocks stand at the edge of the shore, as if guarding hidden secrets and treasure.Go to the Sea of Flowers and find ValayFrom the Emberpup family's bonfire chatter, you learn that the scar on Omega Flameruff's face was left by Recas, the strongest Glynsera. It must be one of the great powers of Beast Fang Ridge too. Maybe it is hiding somewhere inside a secret cave belonging to the Bonesky family.Located on the second floor of Polaris Institute's main hall, it is an internal area of the institute that connects core departments including Aniimology, Pathfinding, and Battle Art.Explore this mysterious place.Bloom - White SandbankSearch for <style=Hint_BgL>Golden Answer</style>.Flameruff from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Twine with Shelly and head to the Uncommon checkpoint aheadAsk the repairer nearbyContinue to collect Voxel CubesAlpha Aniimo: ScorchhowlTell Senior Valay what you foundThis is ≪J67≫ — edit the description freely.Chat with the Fentuft Inspector.The perfumer at the entrance of the Celestis outpost?Catch an EmberpupLumin Marking: Petal ShoresDefeat Thunderstorm Thornblade.Go to the Park Board.Follow Fannie to the Park.Perfumer Dael is anxiously looking at the Nest of Stars.Lumin Marking: Keyhole SightDuring the day, many Baleetles gather at Berylline Causeway, and on sunny days, they race about without a care in the world. At this moment, Baleetle Jenny is standing in the middle of the road, staring blankly at a beautiful mud ball. What’s going on?Ask Prof. Bohr for adviceGo to the Home Co-op Store.This is ≪J67≫ — description editable at your discretion.When the ruined structures become one, you may glimpse the glory this place once knew.Soak the wooden chest so it becomes conductive, then activate the fan.Go to the top of the mountain and find more information about the legend of PawneyGive the new Shell Shovel to SusutaSubmit 10 StarinesReturn to Bloomville.VerticalA group of wretched Budsquires?Find Awen.Adventurous Cozite - Destination: Mystery Island!A group of Budsquires are sharing lore over a pot of tea in the Wildflower Cottage. If you have the time, go have a listen.BridgeDefeat the mysterious being among the nighttime BoneskiesFind the Hummin lost in the woods {0}/5Visit Wendell in Zephyrus LandbridgeWisptis from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Greet the elder.Show the Tubster what freedom feels like.Lumin Marking: Cliff MarkTalk to Zephyro and help the Bell of Freedom bloom.Find the Fragrant Emberpup.Popota from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Starlit blooms weave a velvet green beneath your feet.Use Gravity Pull to move the obstacle aside, then head to the green target point.Listen in on the nearby conversation.All three ingredients have been gathered. Now go back to Bloomville and find Sunia to craft the ancient perfume.Own 6 Shells in your Home warehouse.Go find Dr. Lewis at the outpost and complete the quiz.Use the Emberpup's Fire Bolt to ignite the vines blocking the wayShow Bouldus's Roar.Talk to Fannie in HomeContinue Collection of crystals and head to the Sacred TreeThe Bulbly Family always swims along the Tideblossom Coast at night. Among them, there is one Bulbly that is not by the sea, but pondering by the cliff. Why is it here? What is it thinking about?Go ask Sesa together.Bloom: Argent StraitAs the tide strikes the shore, traces of ancient ruins can be glimpsed between the white surf and pink reefs.Hosts, guests, and uninvited visitors all came and went in haste, leaving behind nothing but a scene of desolate neglect.Go to Sanctum.Stay at the elder’s house for the night.Check the Aniimo's status in your Home.Defeat Glynsera RecasUpgrade a level 1 farmland plot to level 2.Use a Water Skill to activate the Bouncy Pads and head to the checkpointInactive Bloom, go there to activate this Bloom.North of Horizon SquareSet the woodland recipe to Coconut.Help your Emberpup evolve into a Flameruff.Transmit data to the Voxel CoreFly to the Somniwing’s throne.Wait for Xiaochen to finish pre-battle preparationsHead to Astra plaza and set off fireworks for the Starlight Festival!Mysterious visitors seem to come beneath the Blitz Tree at night to share their troubles.Holographic Equipment Malfunction - CaféGive the stubborn Popapus some adviceComplete the initial conversation with Sayn.Continue to move to the green target pointTwine with food-loving Celestis and complete Dr. Glass’s Trial.Bloom: Freshsprout HillTalk to the Bulbly by the cliffView the Facility Management screen.Complete 4 required quests in Chapter 1.Find a buyer for the famous painting Pointillist Hatching Tune.CheekbonesGo to Arlo to process the aromathysts.Ancient canopies weave a dark green dome, scattering daylight into moss-cracked hollows, where silent eyes watch passing travelers.Give Pranky an ideaIs that... <style=Hint_BgL>Jenny?</style>Wait for Fannie at your Home.Twine with a Flutternym and talk to the lost FlutternymSet the time to <style=Hint_BgD>night</style> and get ready to rest.Talk to Grace.Drive away the <style=Hint_BgL>Susuta group</style>.Find the mud ball’s owner.Treasure chestDiscover why the Melloblum can no longer dance.Raise your character to level 60.Talk to lucid Irelia.Give the “Broken Helmet” to Sorora.Catch a <style=Hint_BgD>Dewy</style>.Help the fragrant Emberpup obtain the <style=Hint_BgL>Flareburst Flowers</style>.Show Pointillist Hatching Tune.Shelly from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Search for the Super Truffle.Find a <style=Hint_BgL>Tromber</style> willing to join on a sunny or rainy day.Explore the idol ruins.Here in the Iris habitat, the seedlings are transformed. Yesterday, they turned dun, like the earth. Today, they’re painted with colorless dreams? A cycle of colors, a cycle of intent?Nighttime VisitorsVisit Senior Xiaochen in Rosetower WoodThe honest and gentle Panpantas can unleash astonishing strength when defending its nest.<BR>Respawn Interval: 1 MinuteCatch an Iris!Find a buyer for the famous painting Bouldus's Roar.Fannie visits Home and has something to sayRecas, the Glynsera, does not seem to like the title that marks it as the strongest. Why?Ask Selene.New Perfume Promotion!Learn how to make perfumes from Sunia.NostrilsTalk to Senior ValayReport to Principal OswenHide here.Bloom: Driftwise MeadowLet's look for the mysterious painter Sorora.Search for the truth behind “the Inferlupa’s flying head.”Use the Bouncy Pads in the water again to jump onto the platform and head to the final gateOn the first night, you defeated an Inferlupa that seemed to have lost all will to fight. Then, by the bonfire outside Thousand-Fang Ridge, you heard the legend of the Lost Warrior. There was also a very obvious "eavesdropper." That's where the first night's story ends. What will the second night reveal? If you're curious too, wait quietly for the next night to arrive. <style=Hint_BgL>Real time: 1 day later.</style>Go to Idyll.Grant Coinwisp's wishWho’s the Tubster Basso?Salt wind and Chirpi songs weave through the fjord in endless delight.Sclera ColorPerfumer Awen seems to be looking for something.Talk to Lita and try Holo-Battle SimFind the Pranky holding a leafFly back to the nest and ferment duskwhisper aromathysts.Use the item to restore Scorchhowl's size.Go to the second floor to rest.Deliver the Flareburst Flower.Built by the lake, it's the hub of the whole Northside that connects different shopping streets.Scatter the spices and enter the Amethyst Tree.Use the character’s Hammer Strike to break through the stone wall and reach the next target point.Touch the BloomClimb the wall to the high ground while twined with a CelestisGather the fallen dream blossom.Alpha Aniimo: IgnitisTalk to the mysterious painter.Flickering shadows mask an ancient wonder.Discuss the collectible found in the chest with JiliLead the summoned wild Shelly to the checkpoint by the Bouncy PadsFind or own a <style=Hint_BgL>gull that can handle the bass parts</style>.The seedling seems to have changed.Return to your RV Park.Princess Melloblum seems to know you...?Legend of the Dragon ILumin Marking: Panorama from AfarPranky from today's investigation list lives near this tracking point. Catch the target Aniimo to complete the investigation and earn points!Elvira the perfumer sits by the water, lost in thought. Even Appo the Budclaw can't seem to ease what's weighing on her. Can a scent carry longing? Elvira wants to understand the answer her mother once gave.Complete the enrollment ceremonyWhy does the Alpha Scorchhowl always train alone at the highest point of Beast Fang Ridge?Look for the one with a golden star on its forehead.Talk to Fannie at the Park.Twine with Shelly and extinguish the flames to complete Dr. Glass’s Trial.Look at the painting.A Tale of Ice and Fire V - 2Return to your Home.Place 4 Mineral Piles in HomeGo to the Holo-Lab immediatelyHidden? Stealth! The Great Mushroom Hunt!Go to the perfumery and look for Sunia.Proceed to the Holographic Training RoomInvestigate the Pranky in the middle of the park.Bloom: Crystal CaveA <style=Hint_BgL>curious Susuta?</style>Twine<style=Hint_BgD>Dewy</style>, collect DuskwhisperTake out 10 starinesDepth<style=Hint_BgL>Fight</style> the Inferlupa.Bonesky Family ResearchOpen the Farmland Settings screen.Aniimo Researcher on the ChairAlpha Aniimo: PanpantaBloom: Sea of FlowersCatch Hummin!Take a selfie!Pretend to be the <style=Hint_BgL>Helmut friend</style>.The Infergon of Crimson Peak Forest commands the storms and flames of the mountaintops.Keep Twined with the Celestis and climb the wall to the top.Talk to Elvira.Upper ArmsExplore the Celestis outpost!Talk to the worried PomeggThe Fallen PerfumerA special Budsquire has appeared deep inside the maze.Elvira the perfumer seems troubled near the entrance to Bloomville.A coffee shop that sells various coffees and specialty drinks. The Star-Crossed Tea Party Event is held daily from 18:00 to 2:00, offering exclusive items and rewards. We look forward to 